v 3
d rtablabs: Label variables in a xsvmat dataset from a transposed r(table) matrix
d rtablabs is intended for use in a xsvmat resultsset from a transposed
d r(table) matrix saved by an estimation command.  It allocates
d variable labels to the numeric variables.  The packages xsvmat and 
d descsave can be downloaded from SSC.
d
d Author: Roger Newson
d Distribution-Date: 02September2026
d Stata-Version: 16
f rtablabs.ado
f rtablabs.sthlp
